Damage compared to artifacts is only part of it.  There's also a
huge cost in number of skills slots.  And there's the trouble
that if you use missiles, spells and wands you have reduced
the amount of melee you're doing, so what business do you
have going face-to-face on purpose.  Reduce contact at every
level possible including a sword and gloves.

Master level bare handed (gloved) combat is for a challenge game.

> > I see a late game caveman with bow as primary wielded weapon
